lation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000579489_De_laatste_zet_0_0.jpg","sha256":"24dfc3fa84390130c5e72e522ac5c329e438ae14c10b0e7c4f1ac3ea54e385ad","bytes":270092,"checkedAt":"2026-11-01T14:19:31.452Z","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet1"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2213","key":{"work_id":977100012,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":977100012,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":924300308,"text":"Avery Grambs hoeft nog maar enkele weken in Hawthorne House te blijven voordat de erfenis van Tobias Hawthorne definitief van haar is. Een onbekend meisje dat om hulp vraagt, verstoort die laatste fase. Haar komst brengt nieuwe geheimen naar boven en maakt duidelijk dat het familieverleden nog niet is ontrafeld. Met de Hawthorne-broers probeert Avery te begrijpen wie achter een gevaarlijk laatste spel zit.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1540816/de-laatste-zet.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1540816/de-laatste-zet.html","sha256":"49824d266fae9ac37c958853cdbc77d04217e17d2dd6b7fcac6e9e84f46a34d5","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:58:43.378Z","fact":"Hardback ISBN 9789463493666 verschijningsdatum 12/09/2022 NUR 285 Fictie 15+ imprint Blossom Books uitgever Blossom Books B.V. taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Jennifer Lynn Barnes","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."}]}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789024580453","key":{"edition_id":977200026},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":977200026,"work_id":977100013,"bound_author_id":921300024,"bound_title":"De 